--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: inv::open
visibility: public
--- !node &Alpha
pub port: 1
# `E0216`. A connections item is a reach, so the epistemic gate stands in front
# of it exactly as it stands in front of a clause operand: this edge may not
# name what its own scope cannot see.
#
# The project still emits — only a *cycle* refuses emission — so the image is
# asked the same question the compiler refused, and must give the same answer:
# `connections_readable_from` discloses `Alpha` and not `Secret`.
--- !edge &Reaches
pub connections: [Alpha, ../shut/Secret]
